{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Criminalise pretending to be a member of the armed forces or a veteran",
        "additional_details": "Any person gaining any financial or any type of help by pretending to have served in the Armed Forces past or present should be made a specific criminal offence under charges similar to fraud. This includes turning up to parades wearing medals. ",
        "background": "I want the Government to make it a specific criminal offence for any person to pretend to be serving or to have served in His Majesty\u2019s Armed Forces.",
